  unitName: Grave Carver Aaron
  unitId: 60706
  unitNumber: 925
  description: A demon who lost his will to fight. After exploring region after region
    in search of a way to rid himself of the seal placed upon him, Aaron had far
    exceeded the original limits of his power. It is believed the deeds he had to
    undertake throughout his journey to find the crystal shards holding his power
    only served to make him even stronger than before. However, having lost any interest
    in fighting his older brother yet again, Aaron sought to leave Ishgria behind.
    No records are left depicting any information on the outcome of his journey though,
    so many speculate that something must have happened to him before he could leave
    the region.
  summonDesc: The world will keep spinning anyway. So, is power really necessary?
    Is there no escape...?
  fusionDesc: I like your honest actions. If I could've done the same, things might've
    turned out differently...
  evoDesc: "To think that I'd regain my strength after sealing and denying my power\u2026
    What an ironic world..."
  element: 6
  rarity: 6
